   "hs_code": "24041100",
   "level": 8,
   "chapter": "24",
   "description": "Products intended for inhalation without combustion:-- Containing tobacco or reconstituted tobacco",
   "policy": "Prohibited",
   "condition_text": "Import of electronic cigarettes (e-cigarettes) or any parts or components therof such as refill pods, atomisers, cartridges etc, including all forms of Electronic Nicotine Delivery Systems, Heat Not Burn Products, e-Hookah and the like devices by whatever name and shape, size or form it may have, but does not include any products licensed under the Drugs and Cosmetics Act, 1940 is Prohibited in accordance with the Prohibition of Electronic Cigarettes' (Production, Manufacture, Import, Exports, Transport, Sale, Distribution, Storage and Advertisement) Act, 2019",
